"id":"p9s1","text":"Two layers, switched at runtime with `/web_change` (persisted to `~/.dsh-search-boost-layer.json`):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Layer | Engines dialed | When to use |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| **`free`** (keyless only) | **Bing + DuckDuckGo + Yahoo + Exa MCP (exa-free)** — all live-probed, "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"no API keys | Research loops, zero-cost runs, privacy-conscious use |\n| **`api`** (default) | Same k"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"eyless legs **plus** Antigravity CLI (when `agy` is on PATH) and keyed **Tavily / Brave / Exa** (whe"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"n keys are present) | Maximum recall; cross-engine corroboration with paid APIs |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Keyless engines run **in parallel** so one failure never leaves you empty-handed. Fused ranking adds"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" cross-engine co-occurrence scoring and half-life time-decay freshness."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Built-in `web_search` + `web_fetch` upgrade** | Registers `WebSearchProvider` + `WebFetchProvide"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"r` and patches both seam configs, so built-in search/fetch keep native citation cards while the back"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"end runs on this plugin's engine chain and Jina-first page reader |\n| `fused_search` | Multi-engine "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"fused retrieval with complexity routing, Grok-style query preprocessing (`site:` / `OR` / quotes), d"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"omain filters, cross-engine scoring, and 6h TTL cache. Active layer via `/web_change`; per-call `lay"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"er` override supported |\n| `/web_change` | `/web_change free` → keyless pool only; `/web_change api`"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" → full pool; `/web_change show` → current layer + engine availability |\n| `x_search` | Real-time X/"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"Twitter: posts, users, threads. With credentials: hosted xAI tool ∥ multi-engine (site:x.com), merge"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"d and deduped. **Without credentials**: multi-engine + oEmbed full text (~2s), guest GraphQL user pr"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"ofiles, oEmbed threads. `/x-login` / `/x-logout` toggle the official path |\n| `/x-login` | Import xA"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"I credentials into `~/.dsh-search-boost-xauth.json` (from `~/.grok/auth.json` or `-k <XAI_API_KEY>`)"},{"id":"p15s12","text":". OIDC auto-refresh; grok CLI login untouched |\n| `/x-logout` | Remove `/x-login` credentials; `x_se"},{"id":"p15s13","text":"arch` falls back to the credential-free chain |\n| `fetch_page` | Jina Reader + local HTML fallback +"},{"id":"p15s14","text":" `focus` topic extraction + 24h cache |\n| `deep_research` | Step-mode deep research: complex fused s"},{"id":"p15s15","text":"earch + coverage analysis + gaps + suggested queries, driven by the main agent in rounds |\n| `resear"},{"id":"p15s16","text":"ch_parallel` | Sub-query decomposition → native DSH subagents in parallel → merged sources |\n| `sear"},{"id":"p15s17","text":"ch_stats` | Cache / tier / engine availability / x_search credential audit |\n| Search policy | Injec"},{"id":"p15s18","text":"ted via `systemPrompt.section`: verify time-sensitive facts, route X content to `x_search`, prefer f"},{"id":"p15s19","text":"emPrompt.section`: verify time-sensitive facts, route X content to `x_search`, prefer free engines |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Installation (bundle — recommended)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**From npm (recommended):**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"`--profile <name>` is **required** (`web` is the standard web-UI profile). DSH uses pnpm to resolve "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"the package, auto-wires the `dsh.bundle.patch` layer, and adds it to the profile's bundle list — no "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"manual config editing. Restart `dsh --profile web`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**From source (development):**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Or use the install script (syntax check → key setup → install → verification):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Verify:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Troubleshooting: missing `dsh` or `pnpm`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If you run DSH via `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web`, there is no global `dsh` binary — install globally or"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web`, there is no global `dsh` binary — install globally or use npx directly:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"`dsh plugin` needs **pnpm** (`npm install -g pnpm` or corepack)."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Alternative: session-level dynamic plugin (`plugin-host.js`)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"`plugin-host.js` is a single-file dynamic plugin for per-session boosts. It does **not** replace bui"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"lt-in `web_search`. The bundle form (above) is recommended for deployment-level integration."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Configuration (API keys)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The published bundle contains **no secrets**. Keys load from:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. `~/.dsh-search-boost-keys.json` or `./.search-boost-keys.json`:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"2. Environment: `TAVILY_API_KEY` / `EXA_API_KEY` / `BRAVE_API_KEY`"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Engines without a key are dropped from the fan-out automatically."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**Free layer needs zero configuration.** Bing, DuckDuckGo, Yahoo, and Exa MCP (exa-free) are keyless"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" and run in parallel. Antigravity CLI (`agy`) is optional and only joins in the **`api`** layer (med"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ium/complex tiers) when installed and signed in."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### x_search credentials (optional)"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Command | Effect |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `/x-login` | Import grok login → official hosted x_search path (SuperGrok / X Premium+ tier) |\n| `"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"/x-login -k <XAI_API_KEY>` | Same via console.x.ai API key |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Architecture notes"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- Runs in the **host process** (Node `fetch` / `child_process` directly).\n- HTML scrapers (Bing / DD"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"G / Yahoo) use **IPv4-forced fetch** — undici on Windows defaults to IPv6-first DNS, which intermitt"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"ently times out against search hosts.\n- X search: official path (`lib/xsearch.js`) → credential-free"},{"id":"p43s4","text":" chain (`lib/xfallback.js`: multi-engine + oEmbed + guest GraphQL) with sync preflight when no crede"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"(`lib/xfallback.js`: multi-engine + oEmbed + guest GraphQL) with sync preflight when no credentials."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
